{{! Agency: short sanity notes (projection, disorder, Unnatural). Lines are pre-escaped in chat-card.ts. }}
<div class='agency-chat-card agency-sanity-note'>
  <header class='agency-panel-header'>
    <span><i class='fa-solid fa-brain'></i> {{title}}</span>
  </header>
  {{#each lines}}<div class='agency-sanity-line'>{{{this}}}</div>{{/each}}
</div>